ires him for a long time. Thats why she wants to become his Nr.1 Imouto."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is one of the most popular girls in her school but Yuma is so devoted to Keito that she is completely oblivious to the eyes of the boys in her school."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85530"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"麻木第一学園一年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"響子の娘で学生。景登とは幼馴染。昔から景登のことを慕っており、彼の妹、亜季を差し置いて一番の妹になりたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"パフォーマンス書道をする部活をしており、全国大会に出場する程の実力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園でも屈指の人気を誇るが、景登一筋な為、男子たちの視線に全く気が付いていない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22152","sourceWorkId":"28635","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"麻木第一学園一年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"響子の娘で学生。景登とは幼馴染。昔から景登のことを慕っており、彼の妹、亜季を差し置いて一番の妹になりたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"パフォーマンス書道をする部活をしており、全国大会に出場する程の実力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園でも屈指の人気を誇るが、景登一筋な為、男子たちの視線に全く気が付いていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73737"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dca87ffe94d4544a2a9e6e971311bd87c6e0b9b1e4fb752c8fa43d398976ae5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/2092c377d71846e01dda77437fd218096945b2bdae81d211078222812c6b7014.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南十字いっせい","creatorId":"vndb:s14234","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14234","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14234","name":"南十字 いっせい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:290678:73737:35954:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c85531","characterName":"北川 亜季","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"73738","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"290678"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22153"],"vndbCharacterId":"c85531"},"originalCharacterName":"北川 亜季","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Keito's younger sister. She is a member of the badminton club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the olden days, she was very clingy to her brother and loved him a lot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, when Keito was living in the dormitory, he didnt contact Aki for 2 years since then she has been estranged from Keito and shows him the cold shoulder."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But in reality, she can't help but want to be spoiled by her beloved Nii-nii."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is very tsundere in nature."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85531"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"麻木坂学園二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"景登の妹。バドミントン部に所属している。昔は常に景登にべっとりの甘えん坊だったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼が寮生活の中で二年ほど一切連絡を寄こさなかった事があり、それに拗ね、帰ってきてから疎遠な態度をとり続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、本当は甘えたくて仕方がなく、時折素が出てしまう事がある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22153","sourceWorkId":"28635","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"麻木坂学園二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"景登の妹。バドミントン部に所属している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔は常に景登にべっとりの甘えん坊だったが、彼が寮生活の中で二年ほど一切連絡を寄こさなかった事があり、それに拗ね、帰ってきてから疎遠な態度をとり続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、本当は甘えたくて仕方がなく、時折素が出てしまう事がある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73738"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9df63b18b2cceb00c96e8e6329d10b8c4e90d2b6668ebbd0f4d27a6ff3fe9ba0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/53f9938692e4b2a551bfcc867e970ff96e62b5dd158208e660e5ec1994c641d9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","role